Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.06,0:00:02.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,5 lakh Gujarati farmers. ₹2
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.78,0:00:03.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,each.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.29,0:00:06.41,Sub,,0,0,0,,And a film that reached Cannes!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.89,0:00:08.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,The film: Manthan, 1976,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.83,0:00:10.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,directed by Shyam Benegal.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.42,0:00:13.54,Sub,,0,0,0,,5 lakh × ₹2 = ₹10 lakh.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.57,0:00:16.57,Sub,,0,0,0,,Roughly the film's whole budget!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.05,0:00:18.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,The titles read: '500,000
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.61,0:00:20.33,Sub,,0,0,0,,farmers of Gujarat present'.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.36,0:00:21.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,And farmers came by the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.80,0:00:23.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,truckload to see their film!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.03,0:00:26.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,And in 2024, restored in 4K,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.09,0:00:28.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,a world premiere at the Cannes
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.30,0:00:29.33,Sub,,0,0,0,,Film Festival!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.81,0:00:31.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,India's first crowdfunded film,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.81,0:00:33.13,Sub,,0,0,0,,by Gujarat's farmers.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.16,0:00:34.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,Who are you sending this to?
